    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bastion Frontier</strong> is a dark fantasy <strong>tower defense game</strong> where your mission is to <strong>defend the last Crystal Hearts \u2014 the only source of light left in a dying world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave after wave, grotesque enemies march toward your fortress: <strong>mutant ducks that multiply when killed</strong>, <strong>bone-throwers that rip through your defenses from afar</strong>, and <strong>massive armored beasts</strong> that crush barricades with earth-shaking force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission is to recruit mercenaries and position them strategically to stop the onslaught.</strong> Deploy <strong>gunners</strong> for long-range support, <strong>trap experts</strong> to set explosive surprises, and <strong>melee warriors</strong> to hold the front line.<br>Each lost crystal brings the world one step closer to oblivion. There are no second chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the darkness grows stronger and enemies grow smarter, only sharp tactics and ruthless efficiency will keep the final light alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Atmospheric visuals with a grim fantasy setting<br>\u2694\ufe0f Deep tactical gameplay with varied enemy behaviors<br>\ud83d\udca3 Use bombs, traps, and ranged units to shape the battlefield<br>\ud83e\udddf Endless waves of evolving, unpredictable threats<br>\ud83c\udff0 Defend your fortress and the sacred Crystal Hearts at all costs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How many waves can you endure?</strong><br><strong>How many crystals can you protect?</strong><br>The darkness shows no mercy \u2014 and neither should you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bastion Frontier</strong> is a dark fantasy <strong>tower defense game</strong> where your mission is to <strong>defend the last Crystal Hearts \u2014 the only source of light left in a dying world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave after wave, grotesque enemies march toward your fortress: <strong>mutant ducks that multiply when killed</strong>, <strong>bone-throwers that rip through your defenses from afar</strong>, and <strong>massive armored beasts</strong> that crush barricades with earth-shaking force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission is to recruit mercenaries and position them strategically to stop the onslaught.</strong> Deploy <strong>gunners</strong> for long-range support, <strong>trap experts</strong> to set explosive surprises, and <strong>melee warriors</strong> to hold the front line.<br>Each lost crystal brings the world one step closer to oblivion. There are no second chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the darkness grows stronger and enemies grow smarter, only sharp tactics and ruthless efficiency will keep the final light alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Atmospheric visuals with a grim fantasy setting<br>\u2694\ufe0f Deep tactical gameplay with varied enemy behaviors<br>\ud83d\udca3 Use bombs, traps, and ranged units to shape the battlefield<br>\ud83e\udddf Endless waves of evolving, unpredictable threats<br>\ud83c\udff0 Defend your fortress and the sacred Crystal Hearts at all costs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How many waves can you endure?</strong><br><strong>How many crystals can you protect?</strong><br>The darkness shows no mercy \u2014 and neither should you.</p>",
